 asset acquired from the Company or from another Protected Series, also state the\nconsideration paid, the payor, and the payee. Add pages as needed; keep this schedule current as assets\nare acquired and disposed of.\nAsset description Date acquired Acquired from Consideration / payor /\npayee (if from the\nCompany or another\nseries)\nConsent & Series Exhibit — Audit Coastal Holdings, LLC - PS Bay Equipment — generated by\nMyFloridaSeriesLLC · Master First Edition — August 2026\nPage 4 of 4"}]}
